EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Today is the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Harvest Festival{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
It's my favorite holiday of the year,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
'cause it's all about eating!

{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Usually I just focus on the eating,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
but today I decided to give cooking
a shot too.

{{TAG:0003:000C:}}I tasted a dish too many times{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} and
accidentally ate the whole thing.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Now I gotta start all over again.

